# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PRIVACY: deny-by-default.
#
# The remote is PUBLIC and publishes the template and its tooling only. Every
# presentation in this working directory stays private -- finished and already
# public ones too. Nothing tracked here may carry a name, email, affiliation,
# home path, or photo of a person. Personal defaults live in CLAUDE.local.md,
# which is ignored below.
#
# Adding a deck to the allowlist PUBLISHES it. Don't. See CLAUDE.md section 1.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/*

# --- allowlist: the template and its tooling, nothing else ---------------------
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/template/
!/tools/

# --- kept on disk, deliberately not tracked ------------------------------------
# CLAUDE.local.md               real name, institution, email, style references
# slide-library/                the user's own reusable slides
# shared-assets/                duplicates template/public/logos/ byte for byte
# VerticalSlides/               stale demo; current component ships in template/
# Slidev Example Presentation/  upstream showcase, available from Slidev itself
# Old Presentations/, <YYMMDD-*>/   every deck, private

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Applies inside the allowlisted directories too.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# Build outputs
dist/
.slidev/
*.pdf
*.pptx

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors / agent tooling
.vscode/
.idea/

# Environment
.env
.env.local
